# PropX DataTable UI

When building or changing list tables (admin or tenant):

1. Read `DATATABLE_UI.md` at the repo root (Terminals-style reference).
2. Use `UserDataTable` + `.admin-users-page` / `.admin-users-table` (or existing class pairs).
3. Keep PropX greens: primary `#96c33b`, header tint `rgba(241, 246, 232, 0.5)`, row hover `rgba(150, 195, 59, 0.1)`, Active `#4caf50`, Inactive `#D3494E`.
4. Search, `+ New`, status badges, and `Actions` must match admin Terminals — do not invent a parallel table theme.
